id: rapid-fist
name: Rapid Fist
talentCategory: physical-attack
prerequisites: Enhanced Fist
description: >
  Attacking faster than the eye can see, you leave enemies reeling from your sheer speed and precision.
text: >
  Rapid Fist: Attacking faster than the eye can see, you leave enemies reeling from your sheer speed and precision.
  –Prerequisites: Enhanced Fist
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Strike Roll of your Physical Attacks by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use a Signature Technique that is a Physical Attack, you may double the Diminishing Defense penalty currently suffered by the target(s) of that Attacking Maneuver for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
strike.physical += 1(T);
# (2) A Signature Technique declared as a Physical Attack: asked, once an Encounter - its targets' Diminishing Defense penalty
# doubled on their Dodge against it (maneuvers.mjs askRapidFist, chat.mjs dodgeBonus).
allow rapidFist.diminishing;
